{"4158410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghost Eye", "steam_appid": 4158410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/b97f5b222f41f6ff32ef041dc90cacd8.avif?t=1763948657\" width=1280 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Eye&quot; is a first-person horror adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of John, a father who cannot bear the pain of losing his daughter. He joins a ritual hosted by a mysterious figure known as &quot;The Host&quot; and arrives at &quot;Ghostfall Realm&quot; — a mysterious alien dimension — along with six others in similar predicaments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the dead can be brought back to life here, but the price is that the six living participants will never be able to escape...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will this &quot;battle royale&quot; story unfold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/3996c3458c0ff7ff327ff440890be28f.poster.avif?t=1763948657\" width=426 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/3996c3458c0ff7ff327ff440890be28f.webm?t=1763948657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanic Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, each ritual participant is granted a &quot;Gift&quot; — a special ability to interact with ghosts and spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John’s ability is &quot;Ghost Eye&quot;, which allows him to perceive information that cannot be detected under normal circumstances, including clues left by ghosts and even the spirits themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, the other ritual participants also possess their own unique &quot;Gifts&quot;. Whether to cooperate with them or confront them is entirely up to your choice...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/b97f5b222f41f6ff32ef041dc90cacd8.avif?t=1763948657\" width=1280 height=408 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Eye&quot; is a first-person horror adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells the story of John, a father who cannot bear the pain of losing his daughter. He joins a ritual hosted by a mysterious figure known as &quot;The Host&quot; and arrives at &quot;Ghostfall Realm&quot; — a mysterious alien dimension — along with six others in similar predicaments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the dead can be brought back to life here, but the price is that the six living participants will never be able to escape...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will this &quot;battle royale&quot; story unfold?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/3996c3458c0ff7ff327ff440890be28f.poster.avif?t=1763948657\" width=426 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/extras/3996c3458c0ff7ff327ff440890be28f.webm?t=1763948657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanic Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, each ritual participant is granted a &quot;Gift&quot; — a special ability to interact with ghosts and spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John’s ability is &quot;Ghost Eye&quot;, which allows him to perceive information that cannot be detected under normal circumstances, including clues left by ghosts and even the spirits themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, the other ritual participants also possess their own unique &quot;Gifts&quot;. Whether to cooperate with them or confront them is entirely up to your choice...</p>", "short_description": "John, who couldn’t bear the pain of losing his daughter, joined a mysterious ritual with six others and gained a supernatural power called &quot;Ghost Eye&quot;. Can he complete the ritual before the rest to bring his daughter back to life?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/f7bc0d78424152e72bd6a7540a9303e8babb3350/header.jpg?t=1763948657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/aecb8e6c328fd4b64c32984684375ecf265d34fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763948657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158410/aecb8e6c328fd4b64c32984684375ecf265d34fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763948657", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 448 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["2ndDream Studio"], "publishers": ["2ndDream Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captio